    "text": "2 days ago\nSpaceX sails past TSMC with $2.274 trillion market cap\nAs of early Friday afternoon, SpaceX commands a market capitalization of $2.274 trillion, making it the sixth-largest company in the world, according to Dow Jones Market Data.\nWithin the first hour of live trading, SpaceX leapfrogged TSMC in market cap. The company is larger than Broadcom and Meta, and just shy of Amazon's $2.55 trillion market cap.",
